{"seq":2,"slug":"datacenter-network-architecture","title":"数据中心网络架构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-architecture-design/datacenter-network-architecture","wordCount":1526,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据中心网络架构\">数据中心网络架构</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>数据中心是承载云计算、大数据和AI训练任务的核心基础设施，其内部网络必须满足超低延迟、超高带宽和弹性扩展三重需求。传统三层架构因其收敛比瓶颈和扩展局限已无法适应东西向流量爆发的趋势，Spine-Leaf和VXLAN Fabric架构成为现代数据中心网络的标准范式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"spine-leaf两层架构\">Spine-Leaf两层架构</h3><p>Spine-Leaf架构采用全互联的CLOS拓扑，任意两台服务器之间的通信路径等长（固定2跳），彻底消除了传统三层架构中的STP阻塞和带宽瓶颈：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    S1[&quot;Spine 1&quot;] --- L1[&quot;Leaf 1&quot;]&#10;    S1 --- L2[&quot;Leaf 2&quot;]&#10;    S1 --- L3[&quot;Leaf 3&quot;]&#10;    S1 --- L4[&quot;Leaf 4&quot;]&#10;    S2[&quot;Spine 2&quot;] --- L1&#10;    S2 --- L2&#10;    S2 --- L3&#10;    S2 --- L4&#10;    S3[&quot;Spine 3&quot;] --- L1&#10;    S3 --- L2&#10;    S3 --- L3&#10;    S3 --- L4&#10;    L1 --- SRV1[&quot;服务器机柜1&quot;]&#10;    L2 --- SRV2[&quot;服务器机柜2&quot;]&#10;    L3 --- SRV3[&quot;服务器机柜3&quot;]&#10;    L4 --- SRV4[&quot;服务器机柜4&quot;]\">graph TD\n    S1[\"Spine 1\"] --- L1[\"Leaf 1\"]\n    S1 --- L2[\"Leaf 2\"]\n    S1 --- L3[\"Leaf 3\"]\n    S1 --- L4[\"Leaf 4\"]\n    S2[\"Spine 2\"] --- L1\n    S2 --- L2\n    S2 --- L3\n    S2 --- L4\n    S3[\"Spine 3\"] --- L1\n    S3 --- L2\n    S3 --- L3\n    S3 --- L4\n    L1 --- SRV1[\"服务器机柜1\"]\n    L2 --- SRV2[\"服务器机柜2\"]\n    L3 --- SRV3[\"服务器机柜3\"]\n    L4 --- SRV4[\"服务器机柜4\"]</pre><p><strong>设计原则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Spine层不连接服务器，仅负责Leaf间流量转发</li>\n<li>每台Leaf上联所有Spine，等价多路径（ECMP）负载分担</li>\n<li>带宽设计：上行总带宽 ≥ 下行总带宽 × 收敛比（推荐1:1无收敛）</li>\n<li>扩展方式：增加Leaf节点扩展端口数，增加Spine节点扩展总带宽</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>带宽规划计算</strong>：假设每台Leaf有48个25GE下行端口接服务器，上联Spine的端口带宽需要：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>收敛比</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{uplink} = 48 \\times 25 \\times \\text{收敛比}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ink</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收敛比</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>1:1无收敛时：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1200</mn><mtext> Gbps</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{uplink} = 1200 \\text{ Gbps}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ink</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1200</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Gbps</span></span></span></span></span></span>，可用8个100GE端口或3个400GE端口上联。</p>\n<h3 id=\"vxlan覆盖网络\">VXLAN覆盖网络</h3><p>VXLAN（Virtual Extensible LAN）通过在三层IP网络上构建二层覆盖网络，解决了传统VLAN最大4096个的扩展限制，将网络标识空间扩展到1600万（24位VNI）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>24</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>777</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>216</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{VXLAN} = 2^{24} = 16,777,216</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">24</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">777</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">216</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>VXLAN封装结构</strong>：原始二层帧外层依次封装VXLAN头（8字节，含VNI）→ UDP头（源端口随机、目的端口4789）→ 外层IP头 → 外层以太网帧。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;原始帧&lt;br/&gt;内层MAC + IP + Data&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;VXLAN头&lt;br/&gt;VNI 24bit&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;UDP头&lt;br/&gt;端口4789&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;外层IP头&lt;br/&gt;VTEP IP&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;外层以太网帧&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"原始帧&lt;br/&gt;内层MAC + IP + Data\"] --&gt; B[\"VXLAN头&lt;br/&gt;VNI 24bit\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"UDP头&lt;br/&gt;端口4789\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"外层IP头&lt;br/&gt;VTEP IP\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"外层以太网帧\"]</pre><p>**VTEP（VXLAN Tunnel Endpoint）**是VXLAN隧道的端点，部署在Leaf交换机上。VTEP负责：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>封装：将服务器发出的原始帧封装为VXLAN报文</li>\n<li>解封装：剥离外层封装还原原始帧转发给目标服务器</li>\n<li>MAC学习：通过BGP EVPN控制面学习远端主机的MAC-VNI映射</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>BGP EVPN控制面</strong>取代传统的泛洪学习机制，通过BGP路由协议通告MAC/IP绑定信息，实现精确转发而非盲目泛洪，显著降低了BUM（Broadcast/Unknown unicast/Multicast）流量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据中心互联-dci\">数据中心互联（DCI）</h3><p>多数据中心互联需要解决跨站点的二层延伸和灾备切换：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>VXLAN over DCI</strong>：通过BGP EVPN将VXLAN域扩展到远端数据中心，支持虚拟机跨站点迁移时IP/MAC不变</li>\n<li><strong>专线互联</strong>：同城数据中心使用裸光纤直连（延迟 &lt; 1ms），异地灾备中心使用DWDM波分复用（延迟10-50ms）</li>\n<li><strong>流量工程</strong>：DCI链路带宽昂贵，需要精细的流量调度——优先本地处理，仅将热迁移和数据同步流量放行到DCI链路</li>\n</ul>\n<p>DCI设计中的RPO和RTO计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>数据同步缓冲区大小</mtext><mtext>DCI带宽</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RPO = \\frac{\\text{数据同步缓冲区大小}}{\\text{DCI带宽}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DCI</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">带宽</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数据同步缓冲区大小</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如100GB变化数据通过10Gbps DCI链路同步：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mtext> 秒</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RPO = \\frac{100 \\times 8}{10} = 80 \\text{ 秒}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">100</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">秒</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h3 id=\"超融合基础设施-hci\">超融合基础设施（HCI）</h3><p>超融合将计算、存储、网络虚拟化融合在同一硬件节点上，对网络的特殊要求包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>存储网络流量</strong>：分布式存储（如vSAN、Ceph）的副本同步产生大量东西向流量，每个节点需要至少2×25GE专用存储网络接口</li>\n<li><strong>网络延迟敏感</strong>：存储IO的尾延迟直接影响虚拟机性能，要求交换机端到端延迟 &lt; 5μs</li>\n<li><strong>RDMA支持</strong>：高性能HCI集群使用RoCEv2协议（RDMA over Converged Ethernet），要求网络支持PFC（优先级流控）和ECN（显式拥塞通知）实现无损以太网</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"绿色数据中心与液冷技术\">绿色数据中心与液冷技术</h3><p>数据中心网络设备是PUE（Power Usage Effectiveness）优化的重要环节：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>U</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>数据中心总用电</mtext><mtext>IT设备用电</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PUE = \\frac{\\text{数据中心总用电}}{\\text{IT设备用电}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IT</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">设备用电</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数据中心总用电</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>业界标杆PUE已降至1.1以下。网络相关的节能措施包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设备选型：选择低功耗芯片架构的交换机（单端口功耗对比）</li>\n<li>端口休眠：未使用端口自动关闭激光器</li>\n<li>液冷机柜：高密度服务器和交换机采用浸没式液冷或冷板式液冷，散热效率提升40%以上</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>400GE和800GE光模块正在数据中心Spine层大规模部署，单个Spine交换机可提供51.2Tbps以上的交换容量。AI训练集群推动了InfiniBand和RoCEv2超低延迟网络的快速发展，NVIDIA Quantum-2交换机提供400Gbps/端口的无损RDMA连接。</p>\n<p>可编程交换芯片（如Intel Tofino2）允许在数据面直接执行自定义逻辑（如In-Network Computing），实现负载均衡决策、缓存一致性检查等功能下沉到交换机硬件层面执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>设计一个支持2000台服务器的Spine-Leaf网络，计算需要多少台Spine和Leaf交换机（假设Leaf有48×25GE下行 + 8×100GE上联）</li>\n<li>对比VXLAN Flood-and-Learn模式和BGP EVPN控制面模式的优劣势，说明为什么大规模数据中心必须使用EVPN</li>\n<li>某企业需要在两个相距200km的数据中心之间实现业务双活，DCI带宽为100Gbps，请设计网络互联方案并计算理论RPO</li>\n<li>查阅一个真实的数据中心PUE优化案例，分析网络设备在整体能耗中的占比和优化空间</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>数据中心网络架构的演进反映了应用负载从南北向到东西向的根本性变化。Spine-Leaf全互联拓扑通过等价多路径消除带宽瓶颈，VXLAN在三层Underlay之上构建弹性的二层Overlay满足云化多租户需求，BGP EVPN作为统一控制面实现精确转发和策略管理。理解这些技术的工程师将具备在公有云、私有云和混合云环境中设计和运维网络基础设施的核心竞争力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据中心网络架构","id":"数据中心网络架构"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"Spine-Leaf两层架构","id":"spine-leaf两层架构"},{"level":3,"text":"VXLAN覆盖网络","id":"vxlan覆盖网络"},{"level":3,"text":"数据中心互联（DCI）","id":"数据中心互联-dci"},{"level":3,"text":"超融合基础设施（HCI）","id":"超融合基础设施-hci"},{"level":3,"text":"绿色数据中心与液冷技术","id":"绿色数据中心与液冷技术"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"园区网络规划设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-architecture-design/campus-network-design"},"next":{"title":"网络自动化与DevOps","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-architecture-design/network-automation-devops"}}